        <mxCell id="boundary" parent="1" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" value="View and user download: required for public and private platforms. File labels keep original, faithful copy and derived roles separate.&#10;A missing file or pending receiving handoff keeps collection progress incomplete. Show the next action and owner.&#10;Mapping or product failure preserves safe permitted access. Source acknowledgement and buyer acceptance keep separate results.&#10;Spain examples explain file roles only. Retrieval does not send invoices, select destinations or trigger public fallback." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="1344" x="28" y="1740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
